stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> SourceAuthoritative
    SourceAuthoritative: Source serves users and owns writes
    SourceAuthoritative --> Rehearsal: Copy data to isolated target
    Rehearsal: Target rehearsal has no production authority
    Rehearsal --> SourceAuthoritative: Rehearsal incomplete
    Rehearsal --> SourceStopped: Establish consistency and stop old writer
    SourceStopped: Final transfer verified, no competing writer
    SourceStopped --> SourceAuthoritative: Rehearsed reversal before target writes
    SourceStopped --> TargetAuthoritative: Transfer authority and accept target writes
    TargetAuthoritative: Target owns accepted writes, source is stale
    TargetAuthoritative --> TargetAuthoritative: Continue serving and verify
    TargetAuthoritative --> ReconciledFailback: Application-specific data reconciliation
    ReconciledFailback: Preserve accepted writes and transfer authority
    ReconciledFailback --> SourceAuthoritative
    TargetAuthoritative --> SourceRetired: Retention obligations complete
    SourceRetired --> [*]
